tchRatio":0.4459},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.44049999999999995},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4325},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4233},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.41100000000000003},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.3969},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3918}],"script":{"source_path":"2026-09-berenike-krishna-egypt.md","words":145,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"This ancient Egyptian port had a temple"},{"sec":2.1,"text":"where Krishna stood [music] next to an"},{"sec":3.8,"text":"Egyptian goddess Isis. Trust me, there"},{"sec":6,"text":"is an archaeological evidence for this."},{"sec":7.7,"text":"Ships from India sailed with pepper and"},{"sec":9.5,"text":"gems, and Roman gold went back the other"},{"sec":11.4,"text":"way. And some Indian merchants stayed"},{"sec":13.2,"text":"back. Archaeologists found a plaster"},{"sec":15.1,"text":"panel of Krishna, his brother Balarama,"},{"sec":17.2,"text":"and their sister [music] Subhadra made"},{"sec":18.8,"text":"in Egypt. And Krishna wasn't alone."},{"sec":20.8,"text":"Beside the panel stood a Buddha marble"},{"sec":22.9,"text":"with a halo carved in Alexandria by a"},{"sec":25.2,"text":"Roman sculpture. And its dedication was"},{"sec":27.3,"text":"carved in Greek and Sanskrit. And here's"},{"sec":29.2,"text":"the fascinating thing. These Indians"},{"sec":31.1,"text":"didn't build their own temple. They put"},{"sec":32.8,"text":"their gods inside the Isis temple beside"},{"sec":35.1,"text":"Serapis and Neptune. That was Rome"},{"sec":37.5,"text":"before monotheism took the throne. In"},{"sec":39.4,"text":"391, Rome banned every god in that"},{"sec":41.8,"text":"courtyard. Krishna stayed under the sand"},{"sec":43.8,"text":"for 1,700 years."}],"text":""}}